{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1205872-game-software","id":1205872,"title":"Game Software","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-11T19:33:50-07:00","id":1205872,"title":"Game Software","content":"So, I've been working for an after school program in a high school, running several activities, and one of them is a CofD LARP. The group is getting a lot of good attention, and it's growing.That leaves me with more to do as an ST, and in particular, a lot to do in terms of keeping track of character stats.<br /> <br /> Does anyone know any good software for keeping track of large player-groups? Ideally I'd like something where players can look up and print out their sheet at any point, where I could do the same, and where I can make changes. Additional features are always welcome. It doesn't have to be free, since my program has a budget I can operate within.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1547-bunnirabbi","name":"BunniRabbi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1547_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-12T08:19:06-07:00","id":1206031,"title":"","content":"I'm partial to having a Google Drive that you control and share each player's subfolder to just that player. That way you have control over everything and the players only have access to what they need.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-12T08:24:26-07:00","id":1206034,"title":"","content":"You could use ObsidianPortal.com. The interactive sheets on there aren't the nice official ones so they would look as good printed though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T09:32:08-07:00","id":1207675,"title":"","content":"One thing I didn't think to include in the requirements, which is also a pretty big point, is that I can't use anything with a chat or email like feature. School policy. It's a little like giving kids your phone number. I communicate with them, outside of sessions, through their school emails. Those can be monitored at any time, so the school board allows that. Looking at Obsidian Portal, that seems to rule out the paid-for version, but would allow the free one. I can't tell if they have player-accessible character sheet storage though.<br /> <br /> Google Drive is actually what I have been using so far. It was looking for something with a little more gaming-specific features.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1547-bunnirabbi","name":"BunniRabbi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1547_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T09:39:12-07:00","id":1207678,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BunniRabbi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1205872-game-software?p=1207675#post1207675\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One thing I didn't think to include in the requirements, which is also a pretty big point, is that I can't use anything with a chat or email like feature. School policy. It's a little like giving kids your phone number. I communicate with them, outside of sessions, through their school emails. Those can be monitored at any time, so the school board allows that. Looking at Obsidian Portal, that seems to rule out the paid-for version, but would allow the free one. I can't tell if they have player-accessible character sheet storage though.<br /> <br /> Google Drive is actually what I have been using so far. It was looking for something with a little more gaming-specific features.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The way character sheets on Obsidian Portal would work is you make a character on their system and can set it to use an 'interactive sheet' you can then use a CofD one. They aren't the official PDFs or anything, just a webform.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}